tes more often (on/off)"},{"command":"memory","aliases":[],"action":"memory","description":"See what {name} remembers long-term"},{"command":"pics","aliases":["selfie","selfies"],"action":"pics","description":"Ask {name} to send pictures more often (on/off)"},{"command":"look","aliases":["see","view"],"action":"look","description":"A picture of what you see right now (words after it steer it)"},{"command":"pic","aliases":["photo","custom"],"action":"pic","description":"A picture of {name} as you describe it: /pic \u003chair, makeup, clothes, pose, framing, angle>"},{"command":"spend","aliases":["cost","costs"],"action":"spend","description":"What {name} cost today, and what's left on each account"},{"command":"album","aliases":["gallery"],"action":"album","description":"Every picture {name} has sent you, 10 at a time: /album [page]"},{"command":"face","aliases":[],"action":"face","description":"{name}'s face in her pictures: /face draws new ones to pick from"},{"command":"restart","aliases":["start"],"action":"restart","description":"Start the story over (wipes her memory)"}],"MESSAGES":{"NOTICE_PREFIX":"(setup) ","NEEDS_MEMORY":"This needs memory connected. Open /setup for details.","VOICE_ON":"{name} will send voice notes more often.","VOICE_OFF":"{name} picks voice or text on her own.","MEMORY_SHOW":"{name}'s long-term memory:\n\n{notes}","MEMORY_EMPTY":"Nothing in long-term memory yet. It fills up as the chat grows.","HELP":"How {name} works\n\n{name} is a character, not an assistant. She lives across the hall, has her own day and moods, and answers like a real person: slower when she's busy, quick when you're mid-conversation. Text her, send voice notes or photos (she sees them), or write *actions between asterisks* to be with her in person. She sends voice notes and pictures too (ask any time), may text first when you go quiet, and keeps the important things in long-term memory.\n\nCommands\n{commands}\n\nChanging the story\n- Edit one of your messages the nor